WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.200
Mash keeps the editor and agent beside your workspaces.

00:00:02.200 --> 00:00:07.540
The command palette lists actions with the keys that run them.

00:00:07.540 --> 00:00:12.700
The workspace picker keeps separate projects and agents in view.

00:00:12.700 --> 00:00:17.950
The file finder previews source without leaving the keyboard.

00:00:17.950 --> 00:00:23.900
The review tab shows working changes, a diff, branches, and commits.

00:00:23.900 --> 00:00:25.900
Back in the editor, ready for the next step.
